      "comment": "可复用CSS类（浅色科技监测风）",
      ".monitor-container": {
        "display": "flex",
        "flex-direction": "column",
        "width": "100%",
        "height": "100%",
        "padding": "1.25em",
        "background": "var(--colorBg)",
        "font-size": "var(--fontSize)",
        "color": "var(--colorTextBase)"
      },
      ".summary-stat-card": {
        "display": "flex",
        "flex-direction": "column",
        "justify-content": "space-between",
        "padding": "1.25em",
        "border-radius": "var(--borderRadius)",
        "background": "linear-gradient(135deg, #1990FF 0%, #08A3A5 100%)",
        "color": "#FFFFFF",
        "box-shadow": "var(--boxShadowCard)"
      },
      ".device-card": {
        "display": "flex",
        "flex-direction": "column",
        "gap": "0.75em",
        "padding": "1em",
        "background": "var(--colorBgContainer)",
        "border-radius": "var(--borderRadius)",
        "box-shadow": "var(--boxShadowCard)",
        "border": "1px solid rgba(25, 144, 255, 0.08)"
      },
      ".nav-tab-active": {
        "padding": "0.6em 1.25em",
        "border-radius": "calc(var(--borderRadius) - 2px)",
        "background": "var(--colorPrimary)",
        "color": "#FFFFFF",
        "font-weight": "600"
      },
      ".stat-number": {
        "font-size": "2em",
        "font-weight": "700",
        "line-height": "1.2",
        "color": "var(--colorTextBase)"
      },
      ".stat-value-primary": {
        "font-size": "1.5em",
        "font-weight": "600",
        "color": "var(--colorPrimary)"
      },
      ".stat-value-danger": {
        "font-size": "1.5em",
        "font-weight": "600",
        "color": "var(--colorDanger)"
      }
    },
    "tokenCoverage": 0.95,
    "mappingNotes": [
      "主色 #1990FF 映射为 --colorPrimary，用于激活态导航标签、蓝色正常数值/总数",
      "异常红 #F53F3F 映射为 --colorDanger，用于异常数值强调",
      "青绿色 #08A3A5 映射为 --colorInfo，作为渐变辅助色和次级信息色",
      "文本色 #333333/#666666 分别映射为 --colorTextBase/--colorTextSecondary",
      "浅灰蓝背景 rgba(237,244,251,1) 映射为 --colorBg，作为页面容器背景",
      "白色 #FFFFFF 映射为 --colorBgContainer，用于卡片背景",
      "左侧蓝色渐变统计卡片背景提取为 .summary-stat-card 渐变",
      "设备卡片圆角阴影提取为 .device-card 的边框、阴影和圆角",
      "激活态导航标签蓝色底色提取为 .nav-tab-active",
      "强调数值类 .stat-number/.stat-value-primary/.stat-value-danger 覆盖三种强调状态",
      "所有颜色均通过 CSS 变量暴露，并同步映射到 Less 变量便于主题切换"
